# Autoresearch summary report (scripts/data_analysis/autoresearch_summary/):
# its pipeline intermediates are committed (autoresearch_summary.md §2)
!scripts/data_analysis/autoresearch_summary/data/
!scripts/data_analysis/autoresearch_summary/data/**
# ...but its rendered outputs are not: they rebuild byte-identically from
# those caches via regenerate.sh, and the bundle inlines 72 JPEGs as
# base64, so every rebuild would add ~5 MB of incompressible history.
# stack_visuals/ IS kept -- it is fetched from PR branches, not generated.
plots/data_analysis/autoresearch_summary/*.html
plots/data_analysis/autoresearch_summary/machinery_pages/

# Talk folders under notes/presentations (README.md and figure_style.py stay tracked)
notes/presentations/*/

# Analysis plots: rebuilt from the S3 data, or fetched from S3 (docs/regenerating_local_plots.md)
plots/assessment_plots/
plots/exp2/
plots/experiment/

# Data, models and sim outputs: not in git (Git LFS removed 2026-11-03).
